Value VRP_VERSION (\S+)
Value PLATFORM (\S+)
Value SOFTWARE_VERSION (\S(?:[^\r\n]*\S)?)
Value UPTIME (\S(?:[^\r\n]*\S)?)

Start
  ^\s*VRP\s+\(R\)\s+software,\s+Version\s+${VRP_VERSION}\s+\(${PLATFORM}\s+${SOFTWARE_VERSION}\)
  ^\s*HUAWEI\s+${PLATFORM}\s+.*uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*\S+\s+${PLATFORM}\s+.*[Uu]ptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
